&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a collaborative, curious operations professional with a passion for leading our Legal Innovation &amp;amp; Operations (LIO) team within our Counsel organization. We&#39;re looking for a strategic, detail-oriented builder to lead our team operations strategy from vision to execution. You will manage multiple workstreams, from continuing the work to improve the organization&#39;s technology and automation initiatives to managing our budget and reducing third-party spend where possible. We will task you with solving problems, optimizing processes, and bringing the power of automation and AI into how our work gets done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the charge on defining and driving our legal tech strategy, including setting the vision, building the roadmap, and delivering tools that make our team faster, smarter, and more connected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee our suite of legal systems (like CLM, eBilling, knowledge management and workflow platforms), ensuring they&#39;re optimized, well-integrated, and aligned with how the business actually works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage our core digital platforms, keeping them efficient, intuitive, and budget-conscious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Legal, Policy, IT, Finance, Business Operations and beyond to evaluate and roll out technology and solutions that streamlines work and improves the experience for everyone who touches it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design elegant solutions and connecting the dots between business needs and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with vendors, ensuring we get measurable value from our tech investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multi-quarter, cross-functional projects that push automation, AI, and data-driven insights deeper into how we deliver our work throughout the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create operational excellence wherever opportunities exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in legal operations, tech strategy, or a related operations-focused role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading automation or AI initiatives that drive measurable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity for managing budgets, timelines, and stakeholders, with a sharp eye for detail and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptive communication methods, translating technical detail into clear business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and curious mindset, unafraid to experiment or rethink how things are done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platforms like DocuSign CLM or workflow automation tools (bonus points for hands-on implementation experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building trust quickly and working well with everyone from senior leadership to individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
